  "reason": "The existing evidence is entirely absent, so the first experiment should test a foundational multimodal configuration to establish baseline performance. This experiment tests combining RNA (pca_n2000) and image (resnet50) data with simple concatenation fusion, which clarifies whether multimodal approaches outperform single-modality baselines. It directly addresses the most critical design choice (multimodal vs single-modality) with minimal complexity, providing maximal information about the potential value of integrating multiple data types."
